- A 300 mm Si-W service/cooling annulus.
- A 400 mm HCAL rear gap for outward routing.
- An empty future FCal envelope.
- Updated R–Z drawing and reproducible budget checks. CI is green.

Updated [PR #75](https://github.com/asalzburger/nodd/pull/75) and its matching four-page PDF: :codex-file-citation{path="[redacted]" purpose="output"}. **Merge #76 first, then #75**; #75’s CI is running.

